<title>EGYPT: Egypt's net profit up to 45 mln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt's net profit up to 45 mln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Housing and Development Bank said in a statement published on Monday that net profits rose in the calendar year 1996, the bank's financial year. (All figures are in thousands of Egyptian pounds, comparative figures from the previous year in brackets):</p>
<p> Total deposits     2,122,870 (2,360,194)</p>
<p> Total assets	 5,991,572 (6,020,625)</p>
<p> Reserves		 121,639 (94,536)</p>
<p> Provisions	     239,954 (189,983)</p>
<p> Shareholders funds 5,991,572 (6,020,625)</p>
<p> Net profits	     45,017 (35,745)</p>
<p>(Full name Housing and Development Bank)</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1 yr ceh</p>
</text>
